    "accessibility": {
      "short": "Painted bedroom with blue walls, yellow-orange wooden bed and chairs, green-shuttered window, and hanging pictures.",
      "long": "A vibrant interior painting depicting a modest bedroom. The walls are a striking blue with visible vertical brushwork. A large wooden bed with a high headboard dominates the right side, covered with white bedding and a red blanket. Two matching wooden chairs with woven seats stand near a small wooden table holding a pitcher, basin, and bottles. An open window with green shutters on the left wall lets in bright light. Several framed pictures hang unevenly on the wall above the bed and near the door. The floor is rendered in patchy green, pink, and brown tones, suggesting worn wooden planks.",
